# Comparative analysis of requirements for industrial cleanliness in mechanical engineering

**Authors:** A. Amosov

## Abstract
In this work, the author shows the results of the study of the nomenclature base for industrial cleanliness in domestic sources and compares them with foreign analogues used in related fields of activity. With a detailed analysis of the standards, one can conclude that they are similar. The study presents universal methods for achieving a given surface cleanliness of technological equipment, which allow obtaining a result that meets the requirements of both domestic and international standards.

